    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing though—how do we handle situations where some data might be tucked away in legacy systems or sub-databases that aren't easily accessible? like, what's the legal expectation for finding those \"hidden\" pockets of info to make sure everything is actually gone?",
